Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:09.97,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Yuu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:12.61,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Don't you need to hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.43,0:00:14.59,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:33.33,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,You've got a bit sticking out in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.33,0:00:34.47,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shoot, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.85,0:00:42.80,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,There, fixed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:45.75,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:49.61,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,You're leaving a little earlier than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.61,0:00:52.75,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's the first day. I don't want to be late,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.75,0:00:54.32,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,and I don't want to keep her waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.67,0:00:56.44,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Tell Shikimori-san we said hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.46,0:00:58.44,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.71,0:01:00.43,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.43,0:01:05.43,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Watch out for rocks, and cars, \Nand crows, and shingles...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.43,0:01:07.40,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I will. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.21,0:01:11.07,Main,Motoko; Akisada,0,0,0,,Have a good day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.54,0:01:20.45,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.05,0:01:22.75,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Seriously? Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.79,0:01:42.78,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.29,0:01:53.94,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.88,0:02:03.10,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ma'am, are you all right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:09.34,Main,Lady,0,0,0,,Are {\i1}you{\i0} all right, young man?\N Your hair's a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.07,0:02:13.21,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Let me help you with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.88,0:02:19.72,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I made sure to fix my hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.65,0:02:22.06,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,And all for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:39.53,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.21,0:02:50.06,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Good morning, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.51,0:02:53.16,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Good morning, Izumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:58.32,Main,Girl Student 1,0,0,0,,Look at her! She's {\i1}so{\i0} cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:03:01.12,Main,Girl Student 2,0,0,0,,Wow, you're right! She looks like an idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:06.20,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry I always keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:10.24,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Not at all. I enjoy waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.93,0:03:12.68,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But that aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.22,0:03:16.96,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It looks like you had a rough \Ntime again this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:18.45,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:21.27,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.99,0:03:28.97,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,My girlfriend is super cute,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.84,0:03:31.35,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,but sometimes she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.31,0:03:33.89,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Not cute in the slightest...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:35.10,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:41.38,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm not cute?! That's so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:43.36,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry! I didn't mean to say it out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.05,0:03:45.86,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,That just makes it even worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.13,0:03:48.30,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Er, that's not what I meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.18,0:03:54.32,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:04.89,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,That was close...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:10.14,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry this stuff always happens. \NYou're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:14.15,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You don't need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:18.27,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sometimes, my girlfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:22.89,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I swear... You gotta stop \Nworrying me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:27.54,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,...is incredibly cool.
