Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:04.92,Main,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\an1\fnTimes New Roman\bord1.5\b1\fs28\shad0\3c&H1B191E&\pos(54,310)}#01  {\fs24\fscy110}My Girlfriend Is Super Cute
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:07.84,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,They're in full bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.84,0:06:09.75,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Aren't they beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:11.17,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:17.15,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,They were beautiful during the \Nentrance ceremony last year, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:18.77,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.17,0:06:23.20,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I remember being so nervous that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.32,0:06:30.67,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I remember too, "Ijumi-san."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.67,0:06:32.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You can forget that part!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.95,0:06:36.21,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,There! That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.22,0:06:39.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, everyone's already checking the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:42.18,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Indeed. There's quite a crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:47.22,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you nervous, Izumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.65,0:06:51.10,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I am. We're about to find out\N which class we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:56.79,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,God, please put me in class \Nwith Shikimori-san again this year!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.42,0:07:01.60,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Please... Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.33,0:07:04.76,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Do you really need to pray that hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:09.89,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, I want to be in the same class as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:11.74,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.10,0:07:13.96,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Even if we're in different classes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:16.01,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll come visit you lots.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.01,0:07:17.05,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I love her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.40,0:07:18.41,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,Look, look! Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.41,0:07:19.06,Main,Guy 2,0,0,0,,Move over!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.06,0:07:19.64,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,Look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.64,0:07:20.45,Main,Guy 3,0,0,0,,Outta the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.45,0:07:21.73,Main,Guy 4,0,0,0,,Dude, same class!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:24.21,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b1\pos(75.333,43.333)\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&}Only Wears\NGlasses in Class
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:24.21,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs16\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(582,72.666)}20/20 Vision
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.76,0:07:26.14,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Where's my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:30.72,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(900,1)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\an8\shad0\bord0\pos(488.001,96)\c&H303232&}Class 4
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:30.72,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(900,1)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\an8\shad0\bord0\c&H303232&\pos(342.001,136)}Izumi Yuu
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:30.72,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,There it is! In Class 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:36.85,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,900)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\an8\shad0\bord0\c&H303232&\pos(312.668,101.333)}Izumi Yuu
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:38.04,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,And Shikimori-san, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:43.73,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,1)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\an8\shad0\bord0\c&H303232&\pos(326.001,70.667)}Shikimori
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.41,0:07:48.66,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,We're in the same class, Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:50.17,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Look! It's right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.77,0:07:54.02,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh... So we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.02,0:07:56.62,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thank you, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:08:00.63,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I look forward to studying \Nwith you again this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.63,0:08:04.12,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, likewise! Let's make it a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.35,0:08:06.64,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.79,0:08:10.09,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Neko!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.94,0:08:14.25,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,We're together again this year!\N Hachimitsu, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:15.72,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Sup?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:18.80,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Let's take a pic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:21.57,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:23.72,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Looks like we're in the same class again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.72,0:08:24.99,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Inuzuka-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:29.51,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're in Class 4, too? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.51,0:08:31.25,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Looking forward to another year together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:32.20,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.76,0:08:34.34,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Shikimori's with us, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.48,0:08:36.45,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.86,0:08:39.61,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san, I'll see you later, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.61,0:08:40.69,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:45.08,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we're in the same class.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:49.95,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,But I got kinda carried away, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:52.02,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.27,0:08:56.85,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,By the way, Shikimori-san, \Nwhen we go home today...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.59,0:09:00.85,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Heck, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.91,0:09:04.34,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.43,0:09:08.67,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Looks like you flipped out \Na little too soon, Micchon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.67,0:09:10.19,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You're really on cloud nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.77,0:09:19.95,Main,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,The younger students will now\Nlook up to you as their upperclassmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.45,0:09:23.63,Main,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,You'll most likely be the\Ncentral focus at school events.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:26.38,Main,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,Let's make this a fun year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.97,0:09:29.27,Main,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,I'm sure not all of you are acquainted yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.27,0:09:32.05,Main,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,so let's start with some \Nquick introductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:35.67,Main,Homeroom Teacher,0,0,0,,We'll go in seat number order, \Nso Izumi-kun, you're up first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.67,0:09:36.80,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.10,0:09:40.36,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm Ijumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:42.94,Main,Classmate 1,0,0,0,,He blew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.09,0:09:50.15,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Today, I started my second year of high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.95,0:09:53.84,Main,Classmate 2,0,0,0,,Huh? What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:56.81,Main,Classmate 3,0,0,0,,It just kinda... went flying...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:10:00.69,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san, you never get angry, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.39,0:10:04.08,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You're asking me that {\i1}right now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.22,0:10:06.23,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:09.08,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fnComic Sans MS\fs18\pos(20,25.333)\shad0\bord0\c&HBED9C0&}Today's Schedule \N\N\N\N\N1. Opening Assembly\N\N\N\N\N2. Class Opening Meeting\N\N\N\N\N3. Homeroom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:21.77,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.77,0:10:22.68,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:24.42,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.42,0:10:29.06,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I'm just glad you weren't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:34.10,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry this stuff always happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:41.49,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-I'm going to the restroom to clean up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.86,0:10:42.67,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:44.25,Main,Classmate 4,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.03,0:10:48.68,Main,Classmate 4,0,0,0,,Look at you, showing off. I'm jealous, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:51.45,Main,Classmate 5,0,0,0,,Being naturally unlucky \Nmust really suck, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:55.33,Main,Classmate 6,0,0,0,,Where'd that eraser even come from, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.33,0:10:56.59,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Good question...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.94,0:10:58.59,Main,Classmate 4,0,0,0,,Better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.59,0:11:01.41,Main,Classmate 4,0,0,0,,Don't cause too much trouble for \Nthat cute girlfriend of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.41,0:11:03.69,Main,Classmate 6,0,0,0,,Yeah, she'd get tangled up\N in your misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.19,0:11:09.66,Main,Classmate 5,0,0,0,,Why the heck is Shikimori-san \Nwith {\i1}Izumi{\i0}, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:11.49,Main,Classmate 4,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's so dull.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.77,0:11:13.52,Main,Classmate 4,0,0,0,,I mean, so are we, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:16.02,Main,Classmate 6,0,0,0,,Damn, I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:21.78,Main,Classmate 5,0,0,0,,Seriously, what's a guy gotta do \Nto get a girlfriend that cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.78,0:11:23.07,Main,Classmate 4,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.13,0:11:27.53,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san, I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:31.12,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, hey. Are you okay, Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:32.09,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.09,0:11:36.04,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san, would you mind \Naccompanying me to the library for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:36.89,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.89,0:11:39.49,Main,Classmate 6,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. I hope she didn't hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.49,0:11:41.31,Main,Classmate 4,0,0,0,,Nah, we're probably fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:51.63,Main,Classmate 4,0,0,0,,That was scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.63,0:11:52.57,Main,Classmate 5,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.57,0:11:55.11,Main,Classmate 6,0,0,0,,I-It was kinda awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.11,0:11:57.11,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\b1\c&H6A665F&\bord0\pos(410.666,216.666)}Peace and Harmony {right}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.11,0:11:57.11,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\b1\c&H23244F&\bord0\pos(106.666,277.999)}Be Kind \Nto All {left}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.79,0:12:01.76,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I might just be a little bit petty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:05.11,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.67,0:12:10.16,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I don't think you need to worry \Nabout what happened back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:10.89,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.79,0:12:12.94,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:16.55,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.48,0:12:21.96,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,My girlfriend is cute, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:28.78,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'd really hate it if she were \Nhurt because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:36.86,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.03,0:12:40.18,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Wanna go do something now that school's out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.45,0:12:44.58,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You don't have work today, Inuzuka-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:49.59,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Got the day off to celebrate the \Nstart of a new school year!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.87,0:12:50.89,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let's go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.89,0:12:53.84,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,That's my boy! You might look boring, \Nbut you're down for anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.13,0:12:58.34,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, I've been thinking I want \Nto hang out with you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:13:00.77,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:03.80,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll go let Shikimori-san know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:04.50,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.47,0:13:08.03,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys are going out, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:11.06,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,We should all hang out together, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:13.41,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I guess we're all about \Nto become better friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.41,0:13:15.11,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Is that okay with you, Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.11,0:13:17.09,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes! Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:18.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,This should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.88,0:13:21.46,Main,Shikimori-san,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, you're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:27.53,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Such innocence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.53,0:13:29.48,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Even if we get an unasked-for tag-along.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.48,0:13:30.37,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,You mean me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:32.94,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,I could say the same about you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:40.03,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Loser has to treat whoever \Ngets the highest score.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.32,0:13:41.80,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:46.04,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Count me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.40,0:13:48.09,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,How spirited...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:50.17,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,They sure are raring to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.88,0:13:53.63,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Have you ever bowled before, Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.63,0:13:57.24,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Not very often. Two or three times, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:59.26,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, about the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.76,0:14:06.07,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.20,0:14:12.95,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I-I'll go get our balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.43,0:14:15.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Come with me, Inuzuka-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.01,0:14:16.95,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.94,0:14:20.58,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:23.99,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,This is your chance, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:25.40,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,My chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:27.04,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:29.46,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You pretend to suck at bowling
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.46,0:14:32.11,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,and let your bae have all the glory!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.11,0:14:34.31,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,My b-bae?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.31,0:14:36.49,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But pretending to be bad at it is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.49,0:14:40.43,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,For girls, being bad at stuff \Ntranslates to cuteness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:42.71,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,All right! Let's get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.71,0:14:44.33,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,I'm up first!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:46.26,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.13,0:14:54.82,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Gah! Shoulda known I wouldn't get \Na strike on the first throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:57.71,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\c&H424446&\frz3\pos(185.333,131.334)}Inu
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:57.71,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\c&H424446&\frz3\pos(195.333,318.001)}Neko
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.16,0:14:59.94,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,He's pretty good...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.94,0:15:01.07,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:11.89,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Keep it down, Nekozaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.89,0:15:13.97,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Don't break the pins.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.15,0:15:29.08,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.97,0:15:35.30,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,So slow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.77,0:15:43.03,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.56,0:15:44.58,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Ayup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.58,0:15:46.54,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,That was awesome, Hachimitsu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.13,0:15:53.17,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.45,0:15:54.77,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.18,0:15:56.27,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.27,0:15:57.37,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Uh, nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:16:00.72,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Maybe it {\i1}would{\i0} be better to go for cuteness...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.31,0:16:01.40,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}I can't believe Hachimitsu got a strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:02.94,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}That came outta nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:02.94,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hmm? What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:05.12,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,You're up next, Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.44,0:16:07.30,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:09.36,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Go on, Izumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:11.39,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.69,0:16:17.49,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Think it'll stay on course?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:21.54,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.76,0:16:30.92,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Now {\i1}that{\i0} was a real miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.92,0:16:33.71,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Just too frickin' predictable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.71,0:16:36.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The ball just curved on its own...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.01,0:16:38.26,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\c&H424446&\fs18\fay-.1\pos(64,96.668)}Neko
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.01,0:16:38.26,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\c&H424446&\fs18\fay-.05\pos(64.667,188.668)}Hachimitsu
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.01,0:16:38.26,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\c&H424446&\fs18\fay-.02\pos(68.667,279.334)}Izumi
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.01,0:16:38.26,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\c&H424446&\fs18\pos(70.667,368.667)}Shikimori
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.40,0:16:37.88,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,You're up, Shikimori.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.85,0:16:40.01,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Micchon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.53,0:16:41.84,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You know what to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:45.25,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You want your bae to think \Nyou're cute, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.60,0:16:50.11,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.30,0:16:55.11,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I want to hear that!\N I want to hear him say I'm cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:00.15,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.23,0:17:02.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:23.88,Main,Man,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:26.24,Main,Woman,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.24,0:17:27.84,Main,Man,0,0,0,,She's about to get a perfect score.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.15,0:17:29.64,Main,Woman 2,0,0,0,,Whoa, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.64,0:17:31.62,Main,Woman 3,0,0,0,,For real?! That's nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:34.62,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Y-You gotta be kidding...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:37.10,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,What is she, a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:40.12,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\c&HE986DC&\fs14\frz5\fay-.1\pos(68.667,61.335)}Player {pink}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:40.12,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\c&H626062&\fs12\frz5\fay-.1\pos(76,102.669)}Inu
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:40.12,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\c&H626062&\fs12\frz3\fay-.1\pos(81.333,152.668)}Neko
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:40.12,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\c&H626062&\fs12\frz2\fay-.1\pos(87.333,204.001)}Hachimitsu
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:40.12,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\c&H626062&\fs12\frz1\fay-.1\pos(91.333,253.335)}Izumi
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:40.12,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\bord0\c&H626062&\fs12\fay-.1\pos(97.333,305.335)}Shikimori
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.12,0:17:46.62,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs34\bord0\shad0\an8\c&H140C0F&\pos(311.333,2)}Flawless       Victory
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.51,0:17:53.44,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Th-That was so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:55.26,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san, hold up your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:57.85,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,L-Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.85,0:17:59.31,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.49,0:18:04.97,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,She is seriously so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.34,0:18:08.75,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,All I see is the bold, \Nfearless smile of a powerhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:10.09,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Just what {\i1}is{\i0} she?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.55,0:18:13.48,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I guess she chose looking cool\N over looking cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.93,0:18:20.30,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:21.87,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Bye-bee!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.87,0:18:23.33,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Adieu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.13,0:18:30.67,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.67,0:18:33.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The loser was supposed to treat\N the highest scorer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.74,0:18:36.25,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, you don't have to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:37.80,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:41.27,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,In that case, please walk home with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.52,0:18:46.02,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh? But we always do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:47.90,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,That's why I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.27,0:18:59.07,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,W-Wow, it's so windy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:01.85,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's messing up your hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.85,0:19:04.00,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, you should see yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:09.74,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,There have been a lot of empty cans\N and things blowing around...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.74,0:19:11.39,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,straight at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.39,0:19:12.47,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.73,0:19:21.32,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:22.66,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.48,0:19:27.10,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,How did she stop that newspaper from \Nhitting me without even looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:28.58,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.61,0:19:34.69,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks, Shikimori-san. I really \Nam sorry this stuff always happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.06,0:19:40.19,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Aren't I always telling you\Nthat you don't need to apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.19,0:19:42.69,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry— Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.86,0:19:47.38,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I've gotten used to this kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.38,0:19:48.90,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.66,0:19:55.25,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I feel pathetic when you \Nhave to protect me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:56.92,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs14\pos(389.333,136.667)\fay-.01\3c&H654D2D&\4c&H654D2D&\c&HB4D1CE&}RAKA\NCorp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.18,0:20:04.53,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.74,0:20:09.80,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Did it bother you when those \Nguys in class were teasing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.35,0:20:14.32,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, no... What they said was true, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.58,0:20:17.99,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I really don't do a thing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.93,0:20:23.38,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.81,0:20:40.23,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.49,0:20:49.12,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,All you need to do is stay by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.13,0:20:53.81,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter to me what people may say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.25,0:20:58.53,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep protecting you\N because I {\i1}want{\i0} to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:04.71,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,My girlfriend is so incredibly cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.38,0:21:06.85,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,And for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.71,0:21:08.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.46,0:21:10.38,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-Is this really the time to say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.41,0:21:16.72,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, you're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.72,0:21:18.34,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Is your foot okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:19.55,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:22.20,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Uh, y-yes! It's just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:27.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You were amazing just now! \NIt was almost like... like...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.12,0:21:31.17,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It was just a coincidence! Pure coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.17,0:21:34.32,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:36.24,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:37.56,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:38.83,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.44,0:21:42.59,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure! I'm absolutely fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.59,0:21:44.62,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What about you? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:47.72,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm totally fine, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.27,0:21:49.88,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,That's a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:54.77,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(560,440)\fnArial\b1\fs30\frz7\shad0\3c&HDBE6E5&\c&H5126E8&\pos(498,297.999)}S{\fs28\c&H3DCEFE&}E{\fs26\c&H5126E8&}E {\fs26\c&H3DCEFE&}Y{\fs24\c&H5126E8&}O{\fs22\c&H3DCEFE&}U{\c&H5126E8&}~ {"MATANE~" in ED}
